Dialogue: 3,0:23:19.42,0:23:22.46,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}自指縫間滑落
Dialogue: 3,0:23:22.46,0:23:25.47,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}我試圖去理解
Dialogue: 3,0:23:27.64,0:23:29.30,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如缺失的線索
Dialogue: 3,0:23:29.30,0:23:30.89,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如我沉溺的海洋
Dialogue: 3,0:23:30.89,0:23:32.43,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如舊鞋
Dialogue: 3,0:23:32.43,0:23:35.56,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如那場讓我遇見你的旅程
Dialogue: 3,0:23:35.56,0:23:37.15,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如樹莓汁
Dialogue: 3,0:23:37.15,0:23:38.81,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如我心境
Dialogue: 3,0:23:41.61,0:23:43.82,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}現在 你去往了何處？
Dialogue: 3,0:23:43.82,0:23:46.86,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}我曾如此了解你
Dialogue: 3,0:23:50.41,0:23:52.79,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,0)}你去往了何處？
